---
import Layout from '../components/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Contact | Pakistan Finance Calculators"
  description="Contact Pakistan Finance Calculators to report a wrong result or suggest an improvement."
  slug="/contact/"
>
  <div class="container prose-narrow" style="padding-top:40px;">
    <h1>Contact</h1>
    <p>
      Spotted a wrong result, a stale rate, or a broken page? Tell us what
      you entered, what the tool showed, and what you expected. Please do
      not send personal details, account numbers, or documents.
    </p>
    <div class="notice-warning" role="note">
      <p>
        <strong>Feedback route not yet live.</strong> The contact email
        address and form handling are launch blockers (OQ-14): no email
        address has been invented for this page, and there is no dead
        form here. Once the owner confirms the contact address, this page
        will link to it directly. Until then, use the project
        repository's issue route or the owner's own contact channel.
      </p>
    </div>
    <h2>What to include in a report</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>The tool page and the inputs you used.</li>
      <li>The result shown, and the source or figure you expected.</li>
      <li>The date and time, for rate-related reports.</li>
    </ul>
    <p><a href="/">Back to all calculators</a></p>
  </div>
</Layout>
